WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.080
All right, so my dad's deaf and I know sign language

00:04.080 --> 00:05.680
and working with Johnny,

00:05.680 --> 00:10.680
we've come up with how to get ASL leads

00:10.840 --> 00:12.300
and they're like 12 bucks.

00:12.300 --> 00:14.440
Like we're killing it, we're crushing it.

00:14.440 --> 00:16.920
And I'm gonna crush all AEP because of it.

00:17.920 --> 00:21.240
Working with Johnny and Javier, it's unbelievable.

00:21.240 --> 00:23.840
If you're not working with them already, you're stupid.

00:23.840 --> 00:27.840
And you should be because they're the key to progress

00:27.840 --> 00:29.600
right now, or at least for me.

00:29.600 --> 00:32.100
So join up with them.

